# Fireworks's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-fireworks-setting-api-key = A Fireworks API key from https://app.fireworks.ai/settings/users/api-keys. It reads the account's billing summary.
usage-fireworks-setting-account-slug = The Fireworks account id, needed only when the API key can see several accounts. Find it in the account switcher on https://app.fireworks.ai or with `firectl whoami`.
